start - Start the bot
help - Show help message
quit - Admin only: Make bot leave the group
j - Track your "Jed day" (inline buttons)
picture - Send a random picture
users - Show day count leaderboard
me - Show your day count
from <date> - Calculate time from a date (DD-MM-YYYY)
weather - Get weather forecast
marksix - Get Mark Six reminder
llama - Ask Llama AI
jp - Get random JLPT vocabulary word
draw- Generate an image using AI